arquette County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. August to September came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 61% of normal in September to October and 57% in October to November. Every grid had its driest year in 1958, with grid 28663 at 53%.</p>"}
